{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EXO","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"出埃及记","commonName":"出埃及记","title":"出埃及记","order":2,"numberOfChapters":40,"sha256":"b842caeaed820b1509733186fc954ba411c1dca9ce02e60cbb8414f58e38e4ac","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EXO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":40,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EXO/40.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1212},"chapter":{"number":11,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["所有头胎的都死"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华对摩西说：「我再使一样的灾殃临到法老和埃及，然后他必容你们离开这地。他容你们去的时候，总要催逼你们都从这地出去。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["你要传于百姓的耳中，叫他们男女各人向邻舍要金器银器。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["耶和华叫百姓在埃及人眼前蒙恩，并且摩西在埃及地、法老臣仆，和百姓的眼中看为极大。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["摩西说：「耶和华这样说：『约到半夜，我必出去巡行埃及遍地。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["凡在埃及地，从坐宝座的法老直到磨子后的婢女所有的长子，以及一切头生的牲畜，都必死。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["埃及遍地必有大哀号；从前没有这样的，后来也必没有。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["至于以色列中，无论是人是牲畜，连狗也不敢向他们摇舌，好叫你们知道耶和华是将埃及人和以色列人分别出来。』"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["你这一切臣仆都要俯伏来见我，说：『求你和跟从你的百姓都出去』，然后我要出去。」于是，摩西气忿忿地离开法老，出去了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["耶和华对摩西说：「法老必不听你 们，使我的奇事在埃及地多起来。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["摩西、亚伦在法老面前行了这一切奇事；耶和华使法老的心刚硬，不容以色列人出离他的地。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EXO/11.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EXO/12.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EXO/10.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}